      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Datsuns are a hard rock band from Cambridge, New Zealand, formed in 2000. To date they have released six albums and several singles, most of which have charted in New Zealand and/or the United Kingdom. \"Deep Sleep\", their latest record was released in October 2014.",
